	Ok, first thing is that you don't need the Bell at the bottom of the
Gnome Mines.  The secret of the Gnome Mines can be uncovered by merely
searching the right spaces.  The Amulet is _much_ further down, on the very
lowest level of Gehennom.  The Book and Candelabrum are secreted away in
various locations in Gehennom.  By the way, I would advise saving the Book for
last, once you *know* where the Amulet is and have prepared a quick route to
get there.

